ling color, with bursts of crystalline notes, whimsical companions to follow and soothing sound spheres to tune into.\n\nThe music adapts as you move, so the soundtrack feels like part of the controls, and the mood is meditative rather than demanding. Movement is fluid and the puzzles are light. Single-player, with full controller support, and suited to players who want a quiet, music-centered experience to wind down with."}}